# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Reorder three known cards, choose whether to shuffle, then draw.
# Forcing: Ponder is the only spell; distinct library cards expose order preservation.
# AI behavior: No opposing hand or board decisions compete with resolution.
# Failure modes: Missing choice, wrong draw, unwanted shuffle, or stale priority fails the flow.
# Card roles: Ponder offers the branch; Island pays; Swamp proves continued play; six basics identify the library.
# Protocol path: OrderReq, optional shuffle decision, draw, and fresh legal actions.
